</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>McConnell’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$26.5m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$66.27m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played two seasons at Duquesne and two at Arizona, went undrafted in 2015, and was paid <strong>$525k</strong> in his first NBA season. He has since earned more than <strong>$66m</strong> without ever being drafted or selected as an All-Star.</p>

